# my-agent .gitignore (Marty, 2026-09-28). Rule of thumb: source is tracked, everything
# that is private, secret, runtime state, a download, or someone else's repo is not.
# Private GitHub repo; this export is scanned with secret_scan.py and the full private-terms list before every push.

# --- private data: never in history (Lukas, 2026-09-24: private stays in the house)
private/
uploads/
proposals/
dashboard/outbox/
jr/history/
jr/library/
jr/drafts/
jr/computer/
scratchpad/
tmp/
deals/business.json
**/chats/
**/test-chats/
**/private_names.json
dashboard/outbox-source/
dashboard/Claude outputs/
tools/screenshots/
**/shots/
dashboard/status.json
tools/local_knowledge/
tools/avatar.scope.json
tools/staged-watchers/status.json
tools/staged-watchers/plan.json
jack_marty_local/Vault/Backups/
jack_marty_local/Vault/graph_state.json
**/seed_placeholder_data.py

# --- secrets and credential stores
hands/grant.json
